    commonMistakes: ["Giving a memorized answer without explaining the invariant, trade-off, or practical use case for: Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters", "Ignoring edge cases, complexity, testing, security, or failure handling.", "Choosing a technology because it is familiar without tying it to the actual requirement."],
